# Piwik PRO

> Piwik PRO is a privacy-focused analytics and data activation platform for organizations that need reliable behavioral data, strong data control, privacy compliance and the ability to turn insights into marketing actions.

# About

Piwik PRO combines four integrated modules: Analytics, Tag Manager, Data Activation and Consent Management. The platform supports web and mobile analytics, customer journey analysis, privacy-conscious data collection, data activation, integrations and controlled access to raw data.

Piwik PRO is designed for organizations with demanding privacy, security and data-governance requirements, including healthcare, financial services, energy and utilities, government and the public sector.

